    "//starboard/nx/arm64/shared/platform_configuration/configuration.gni")

# aarch64 LP64 ABI (same shape as devkitA64). Without this the copied
# linux/x64x11 config would select the x64 SABI and SB_IS_ARCH_X64 would be set.
